`GET rest.v19.adminCustomtableName` — GET /rest/v19/adminCustom{tableName}

This endpoint returns all rows for the specified data table.

Set these collection variables before sending: `tableName`

`POST rest.v19.adminCustomtableName` — POST /rest/v19/adminCustom{tableName}

This endpoint is used to create a new row for the specified data table.

Set these collection variables before sending: `tableName`

`DELETE rest.v19.adminCustomtableName.rowId` — DELETE /rest/v19/adminCustom{tableName}/{rowId}

This endpoint is used to delete the specified data table row.

Set these collection variables before sending: `tableName`

`GET rest.v19.adminCustomtableName.rowId` — GET /rest/v19/adminCustom{tableName}/{rowId}

This endpoint returns the specified data table row.

Set these collection variables before sending: `tableName`

`POST rest.v19.adminCustomtableName.rowId` — POST /rest/v19/adminCustom{tableName}/{rowId}

This endpoint is used to update the specified data table row.

Set these collection variables before sending: `tableName`

